olor:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">huíwēn le! yǔ lái le……</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">기온이 다시 올랐습니다! 비가 옵니다……</div><div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">了가 두 번 쓰여서 날씨가 전과 달라졌다는 것을 나타냅니다</div><div style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">了</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">le</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">~했다, 상황이 바뀌었다</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">雨</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">yǔ</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">비</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">回温</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">huíwēn</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">기온이 다시 오르다</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">来</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">lái</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">오다</span></div></div><div style=\"margin:8px 0\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/day40-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/day40-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div><div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNWUNpR25GLWdoN0NnOXpqVDVTbnFKTVhzOElw